# Screenshots of the Simulation tab on examples/ihp-inv: the testbench setup form and
# the results table after a run (the window is tall so both are in view). Needs
# PDK_ROOT, CDEPT_NGSPICE, CDEPT_XSCHEM. Writes sim-setup.png, sim-results.png.
# Run: scripts/gen-doc-screenshots.sh docs/screenshots/simulation.script
window 1400 1750
panel Library Manager
wait 0.3
open cells tb_inv testbench
sim expect_target cells/tb_inv/testbench
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/sim-setup.png
sim run
sim wait
sim expect_rows 3 PASS
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/sim-results.png
quit
